{"t":1787836876394,"event":{"type":"agent:critique","iteration":0,"defects":["Text critic (severity=medium): CRITIQUE:\n\n- [BLOCKER] Badge text \"3\" is illegible — font size 10px with 18×18 container creates cramped text with no breathing room. The text appears to be positioned at the same coordinates as the badge container (741,123), likely causing clipping or misalignment. Increase badge to 20×20 minimum and use 11-12px font with proper centering.\n- [BLOCKER] Badge lacks visual elevation — as an interactive notification element overlaying the cart icon, it needs shadow to separate from background. Add `pen_set_shadow` with (0,2,4,#0000001a) to \"Cart Badge\".\n- [MAJOR] Cart icon stroke color #374151 is not bound to design tokens — should use `text` token (#0f172a) or `text-muted` (#475569) for consistency with navbar links.\n- [MAJOR] Badge fill #ef4444 is hardcoded red not bound to tokens — should ","VLM critic (score=3/10, severity=high):","  - [high] Reorder navbar elements to place cart icon BETWEEN navigation links and Sign Up button (currently placed after button, violating explicit requirement)","  - [high] Add proper spacing: 16px between cart and button, 40px touch target for cart with hover state, badge positioned at icon top-right with 4px internal padding","  - [med] Refine badge styling: desaturated red (rose-500), font-weight 600, 10px size, subtle shadow, white border, optically centered '3'","  - [med] Match cart icon color to navigation text (gray-600) and add consistent stroke weight (1.5px)","  - [low] Add micro-interaction: cart icon scales 1.05 on hover with subtle gray background, badge has subtle pulse animation on update"],"validation":{"totalShapes":4,"textShapes":1,"cardShapes":0,"textShapesWithWeight":1,"cardShapesWithShadow":0,"autoLayoutContainers":2},"textSeverity":"medium","vlmSeverity":"high","vlmScore":3}}
