{"t":1787836945516,"event":{"type":"agent:critique","iteration":1,"defects":["Text critic (severity=medium): CRITIQUE:\n\n- [BLOCKER] Cart icon uses stroke color #475569 (text-muted) which has 3.1:1 contrast against #f8fafc background — fails WCAG AA for UI components (need 3:1, barely passes but risky). More critically, the icon has no fill and no hover state, making it appear disabled. Change stroke to #0f172a (text) for 12.6:1 contrast, or add a subtle fill on hover.\n- [MAJOR] Cart Button frame has transparent fill with no visible hit area — users won't perceive this as clickable. Add a hover state with surface-2 (#f1f5f9) fill and 8px corner radius to match typical button affordances.\n- [MAJOR] Cart Badge at 20×20px with 11px text creates cramped typography — the \"3\" has insufficient breathing room. Increase badge to 24×24px with 12px font size, or reduce to 18×18px with 10px font size for bett","VLM critic (score=3/10, severity=high):","  - [high] Add 'Sign Up' text label inside the blue button with white color, 14px font-weight 600, and proper padding","  - [high] Fix cart badge positioning: overlap top-right corner of cart icon with 18x18px circle, 10px white text, shadow-sm, 1px white border","  - [high] Add 16px gap between cart icon and Sign Up button, align all elements to centerline with items-center","  - [med] Wrap cart icon in 40x40px interactive button with hover:bg-slate-100 rounded-full transition and cursor-pointer","  - [med] Reduce badge red saturation to #DC2626 and add cart icon hover state matching navigation interaction patterns"],"validation":{"totalShapes":4,"textShapes":1,"cardShapes":0,"textShapesWithWeight":1,"cardShapesWithShadow":0,"autoLayoutContainers":2},"textSeverity":"medium","vlmSeverity":"high","vlmScore":3}}
